+# PURPOSE: Forward legacy boundaries to the exact installed fresh-quota owners.
+# CONTRACT: RT-FRESH-QUOTA-005; source mismatches refuse rather than load a checkout.
+# DEPENDS: Pinned quota admission/config and native status owners only.
+# CEILING: No quota arithmetic, collection, account discovery or persistent writes.
+"""Exact-release adapter. Quota decisions belong to the installed quota owners."""
